WARNING: Vibe-coded against one machine only (Omarchy, Sound Blaster AE-7
1102:0010 subsystem 1102:0081 behind an ASMedia ASM1083/1085 rev 03).
Not tested on any other system. Use at your own risk. These changes can
hard-lock the machine, kill the PCI function until a full PSU power-off,
or IRQ-storm a dead card. Do not drop pci-stub. Do not bind a card whose
PCI config is 0xffffffff.

Apply to Linux 7.2.15 sound/hda/ with:
  patch -p1 < patches/ae7-7.2.15.patch
from the kernel tree root. The 7.1.9 patch does not apply cleanly here.

